      "description": "Watch Charlton Athletic vs Derby County highlights and goals from Championship on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 15, 2026. The Championship clash between Charlton Athletic and Derby County on 2026-08-15 delivered a captivating contest filled with tactical battles and individual brilliance. Both teams entered the fray looking to assert their dominance in a match that would eventually be decided by a dramatic shift in momentum. Derby Strike Early The match began with high intensity as Derby County looked to impose themselves away from home. Their persistence paid off in the 23rd minute when Carlton Morris turned provider, setting up Sammie Szmodics for a well-taken finish to break the deadlock. Charlton Athletic struggled to find their rhythm in the opening period, trailing at the break despite some flashes of promise as the visitors' defense held firm. The Second Half Surge The momentum shifted significantly after the restart as the home side began to pin their opponents back. Shortly after Sondre Klingen Langaas received a yellow card for the visitors, the pressure told in the 61st minute. Karlan Grant delivered a precise ball for Lloyd Jones , who clinically leveled the score. The equalizer injected new life into the stadium, prompting a series of tactical changes from both managers to search for a decisive edge. Campbell's Decisive Moment As the clock ticked down, the tension reached its peak. In the 80th minute, the turnaround was complete when Tyreece Campbell found the back of the net to put Charlton Athletic ahead for the first time. Despite a flurry of late substitutions and yellow cards for Alex Mowatt and Rhian Brewster as tempers flared in ten minutes of stoppage time, the hosts held their ground. It was a resilient performance that saw Charlton claim all three points in a classic football encounter."
